node_modules
/out
test-plate.png
.env
.env.local
# Personal + third-party-licensed assets stay local (creator cutouts, brand
# logos) — deny-by-default so nothing private is ever tracked by accident.
# Bundled OFL fonts are the one carve-out: repo content that must ship
# (see assets/fonts/LICENSE.md).
assets/*
!assets/fonts/
overlays/*.local.json
.worktrees/
# Local matting weights: pinned by sha-256 in src/segment.ts, fetched on
# demand, never committed (half a gigabyte of third-party model bytes).
# (Root-anchored, no trailing slash: the worktree convenience symlink must be
# ignored too — a committed symlink holds an absolute path that breaks fresh
# checkouts — while src/models.ts and future nested names stay trackable.)
/models
